sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title Feature: Privacy Mode (Secure Shutdown)

    actor Blind User
    participant App as App UI / Mic
    participant Mgr as Mode Manager
    participant Cloud as Cloud/Storage
    participant Cam as Camera Hardware

    %% Step 1: Blind User Command
    Blind User->>App: Toggle "Privacy Mode" ON
    App->>Mgr: Event: PRIVACY_ENABLED

    %% Step 2: Locking Down
    activate Mgr
    Note right of Mgr: Critical: Stop all data collection

    Mgr->>Cam: Command: STOP_STREAM
    Cam-->>Mgr: Ack: Stream Stopped

    Mgr->>Cloud: Command: DISABLE_LOGGING
    Cloud-->>Mgr: Ack: Logging Paused
    deactivate Mgr

    %% Step 3: Confirmation
    Mgr->>App: Update UI (Show Lock Icon)
    App-->>Blind User: "Privacy Mode Active. Camera blocked."
